;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; * For PUBLIC, it stores&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&#39;ALL&#39;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
